-has-big width=800 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342540/extras/5e4a2596fe3991d6080a7ffae45f2915.avif?t=1740208951\" data-has-big width=800 height=538 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the black and white theme, two themes are also supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342540/extras/8bf5745dfb8e2f0a7480ad277e02547d.avif?t=1740208951\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342540/extras/6d1e849124309a8f2c43bc7f1af3a571.avif?t=1740208951\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English and chinese language supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
